my $CODE = <<'END_CODE';
Hello World Test
END_CODE

{
    desc => q{D deletes to end of line},
    description => <<'END_DESC',
Action: `D` deletes from the cursor to the end of the line

Macro: `xt/visual/macros/delete_eol_D`

**initial.png** (before):
- Line 1: `Hello World Test`
- Cursor at line 1, col 0

Keys: `6lD`

**after_D.png** (after):
- Line 1: `Hello ` (`World Test` deleted from col 6 onward)
- Cursor at line 1, col 5 (last character)
END_DESC
    run => sub {
        my ($ctx) = @_;
        $ctx->buffer->set_text($CODE);
        $ctx->delay(100);
        $ctx->snapshot('initial');
        $ctx->delay(100);
        $ctx->keys('6lD');
        $ctx->delay(100);
        $ctx->snapshot('after_D');
    },
}
